
<Defs xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="rimworld ../DefsSchema.xsd" xmlns="rimworld">

    <!-- Big & Small feature switches for Project Momo.

         Nothing is enabled yet. Phase 5 (Insects) decides if SapientAnimals
         turns on, and nothing else needs these switches for now. Keeping the
         def here means one obvious place to flip the switch later, and RimWorld
         proves the wiring works by loading this def without errors.

         To enable a feature later, add it to enabledFeatures:
           <enabledFeatures>
             <li>SapientAnimals</li>
           </enabledFeatures>
         Valid values: SapientAnimals, SapientMechanoids. -->

    <BigAndSmall.GlobalSettings>
        <defName>PMM_GlobalSettings</defName>
    </BigAndSmall.GlobalSettings>

</Defs>
